Z||000002||gusto||09-18-2001||01:09 AM||||whats the problem?....hmmm where to start? Ok first my head lights won't move.(ones up and ones down)  I have to rev up my engine for about 5 min. when i start it everyday.(my brother believes its because of the wires and plugs, i'm replacing them this weekend)  The deck lid button dose'nt work, and the lock is missing so I open my trunk with a screw driver. I know what your thinking, go to auto zone and buy a new one....right?....well the hole is completely stripped. I'm going to have it cover if i can get the auto release to work. There are also a variety of sqweeks and knocks. One day after driveing for about 20min smoke started pouring out of the passenger side decklid vent, it stoped after about 5mins and hasent done it since. Oh and I seem to be burning fuel really fast. (in that same trip I used up just about half a tank)  Ok thats enough for now, i'm sure there is more I have'nt noticed yet. If there is someone close who would like to take a look at it for me just let me know.                                                                    -Thanks||||reg||5
