Z||000006||8Ball||09-18-2001||08:46 PM||||Heh Your Fiero sounds almost exactly like mine.<BR>My trunk release had a loose wire. Easy fix.<BR>I had what I thought was smoke out of the passenger vent. Turned out to be steam from a leaky water pump. Replaced it but today I noticed it is leaking again but it seems to be comeing from a bolt in the water pump this time. My lock for the decklid was gutted as well. Got new locks all the way around. My headlights don't go down but hey that is minor atm. Mechanically the car is great except for the cooling system. Slowly trying to fix that. Eletronically the car is a friggin mess and I may never get it all right but hey this is what it is all about  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Btw I live in maryville TN just outside of knoxville. So if your ever heading this way email me and maybe we can meet up.<P>Randy||||reg||1
